sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant APIServer as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Kueue Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as Kueue Controller<br/>Workload Reconciler
    participant Scheduler as Kueue Scheduler
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>ServiceMonitor

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User,Scheduler: Flow 1: Workload Admission
        User->>APIServer: Submit Job (e.g., PyTorchJob)<br/>Auth: User credentials
        APIServer->>Webhook: POST /mutate-kubeflow-org-v1-pytorchjob<br/>443→9443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: CA bundle
        Webhook->>Webhook: Inject queue label<br/>Set suspend=true
        Webhook-->>APIServer: Admission Response<br/>(mutated Job)
        APIServer-->>User: Job Created (suspended)

        Note over Controller,Scheduler: Async reconciliation
        APIServer->>Controller: Watch event: new Job<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>APIServer: Create Workload CR<br/>with resource requirements
        Scheduler->>APIServer: Watch Workloads & ClusterQueues
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: Evaluate quota,<br/>fair sharing, priority
        Scheduler->>APIServer: Update Workload status:<br/>admitted=true
        Controller->>APIServer: Patch Job: suspend=false
        Note over APIServer: Pods now schedulable
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Prom,APIServer: Flow 2: Metrics Collection
        Prom->>Controller: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: Bearer token (SA)
        Controller->>APIServer: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        APIServer-->>Controller: Auth result
        Controller-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
    end
